mble (skill)\">Tumble +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Tumble_(skill)\" title=\"Tumble (skill)\">Tumble +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Tumble_(skill)\" title=\"Tumble (skill)\">Tumble</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tumbleweed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Tumbleweed.png/420px-Tumbleweed.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"325\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tumbleweed.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This silver ring has a series of small barbs engraved on the outside of the ring. It was said to have been worn by an infamous cutpurse that disappeared investigating the ruins beneath Stormreach.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817063744\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreproce